{"title":"University of South Carolina High School Math Contest/1993 Exam/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Carolina_High_School_Math_Contest/1993_Exam/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/2/c92ddd83c744a2c60a35d4fbc15e2fd39200b17e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = \\frac{1 + x}{1 - 3x}, f_1(x) = f(f(x)), f_2(x) = f(f_1(x)),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"391\" height=\"37\" /> and in general <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/d/31d68d3a5e68f4b6f97cada28839ea7176fece97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_n(x) = f(f_{n-1}(x)),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"158\" height=\"20\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/1/991594bc6137e78ec4d6a4488e0d2d76e8a27b58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_{1993}(3)=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"78\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/e/05e4773b2648f5283a450bb27e1fcda8639e663c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ }3 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }1993 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ }\\frac 12 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ }\\frac 15 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } -2^{-1993}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"436\" height=\"37\" /></center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Carolina_High_School_Math_Contest/1993_Exam/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/a/74afeb31c5d31b7a5a829b05c67e25a89c20aac0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(3) = \\frac{1 + 3}{1 - 3\\cdot 3} = -\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"175\" height=\"38\" />.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/8/4d85e5b4ba9c70f9ed222099009725eb727bd76d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_1(3) = f(-\\frac12) = \\frac{1 - \\frac12}{1 + 3\\cdot\\frac12} = \\frac15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"244\" height=\"47\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/9/459108501f31acf1a2f4dba1f4cee2da60f4897f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle f_2(3) = f(\\frac15) = \\frac{1 + \\frac15}{1 - 3\\cdot\\frac15} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"227\" height=\"47\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/1/8e1343c7a96906d33b3a07468c2c4a6cc579ff35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_3(3) = f(3) = \\frac{1 + 3}{1 - 3\\cdot 3} = -\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"238\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>It follows immediately that the function cycles and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/3/ad3e8de6227ef22c8a905fdb271132c58503d4ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_n(3) = -\\frac12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"94\" height=\"38\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/1/0b1d203d9bbdf9974f1948d1c3c53a8133e1e55a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 3k$\" width=\"53\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/a/95a23d4616c93e4a9b8f547838481c82c6a25220.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_n(3) = \\frac15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"77\" height=\"37\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a17fc9c9ba4705bae052721d54e5e599dcebcaee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 3k + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"87\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/9/e891abb94f421424c0c08e6eb49ee82415652cba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_n(3) = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/3/503c9768fec3754f74045c5dec24fd15e75b7aae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 3k + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94b9e62babb94f5d2f95420bfb30d9772ecacf7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1993 = 3\\cdot 664 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"140\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/c/9ec9679742267bf7525922a5f87a0af329c65f9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_{1993}(3) = \\frac 15 \\Longrightarrow \\mathrm{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"162\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nAlternatively, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/0/310b27945065b3a07afa7c71672dcf353946d071.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_1(x) = f(f(x)) = \\frac{1 + f(x)}{1 - 3f(x)} = \\frac{1 + \\frac{1 + x}{1 - 3x}}{1 - 3\\frac{1 + x}{1 - 3x}} = \\frac{(1 - 3x) + (1 + x)}{(1 - 3x) - 3(1 + x)} = \\frac{2 - 2x}{-2 - 6x} = \\frac{x - 1}{3x + 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"684\" height=\"48\" />.  Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/c/87c156766f7cad56103d5a68319a76c7413ab06a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_2(x) = f(f_1(x)) = \\frac{1 + \\frac{x - 1}{3x + 1}}{1 - 3\\frac{x - 1}{3x + 1}} = \\frac{(3x + 1) + (x - 1)}{(3x + 1) - 3(x - 1)} = \\frac{4x}{4} = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"497\" height=\"50\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/6/5f6f3cf88495877cc018911712455e9614031b41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_{3k + 2}(x)  = f(f(f(f_{3k - 1})))(x) = f_{3k - 1}(x) = \\ldots = f_2(x) = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"464\" height=\"18\" />.  Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/e/7ae95e60bb744ee92538346de1b0ed2d6dd9a827.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_{1993}(x) = f(f(f_{1991}(x))) = f(f(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"278\" height=\"18\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/1/4d165b298d8d01841c36f1b7922a8cc17361e460.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_{1993}(3) = f(f(3)) = \\frac15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"178\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Carolina_High_School_Math_Contest/1993_Exam/Problem_23\" title=\"University of South Carolina High School Math Contest/1993 Exam/Problem 23\">Previous Problem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Carolina_High_School_Math_Contest/1993_Exam/Problem_25\" title=\"University of South Carolina High School Math Contest/1993 Exam/Problem 25\">Next Problem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Carolina_High_School_Math_Contest/1993_Exam\" title=\"University of South Carolina High School Math Contest/1993 Exam\">Back to Exam</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018110648\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.025 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 76/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4700/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:3438:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018110648 and revision id 9716. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}